{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16994","headline":"酬严维秋夜见寄 · 武元衡","name":"酬严维秋夜见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥夜思悠悠，闻钟远梦休。\n乱林萤烛暗，零露竹风秋。\n啓户云归栋，褰帘月上钩。\n昭明逢圣代，羁旅别沧洲。\n骑省潘郎思，衡闱宋玉愁。\n神仙慙李郭，词赋谢曹刘。\n松柏应无变，琼瑶不可酬。\n谁堪此时景，寂寞下高楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}